  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "89266f42-6146-4af1-bdbc-34f5619c4609",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "8cebd129-3b8b-4f87-ad08-9d2f63233a04",
          "textContent": "<p>Uma rotina de cuidado pode aparecer em uma frase muito curta.</p><p><strong>Me desmaquillo antes de dormir.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Tiro a maquiagem antes de dormir.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/77f816d3b0654b749d7c6b176d94803f_b01-me-desmaquillo-antes-de-dormir.png?Expires=1794099638&Signature=jvXOsIqgrw-w0WU633aexTwWkUs~pn3PXqEoOjM0nXQkZazsDBnzJ8d3Ysr3AUrYU1shq0bqyPVWan4sgDohf51rCylQM686UshlNdxNcrnyky9SGxGzxRaUxmAok~ak5WlMKSZAjv6o60Qex88tztUvGONaJf45lGmCZtFGLIMcmY5WVwgzAmP3U3gFvL0YIRWLgGyhl7CPXkVNU2~5hyhEL8WYbXR3y6taYzy6jUjhl3k3Kyco4e3lkNFVgZj45ui2gOp7xP1YR4SpxeNcq-LqQKa2E2gxYnSkM8WIBFpYs7nhP~xkiyBlXQcioTMwFDGJd2WYP6ROqFZi5TcBrA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9f6d1aa5837f48fb85cd96926dc74931_b01-me-desmaquillo-antes-de-dormir.mp3?Expires=1794099638&Signature=Nb07aRescH7TWTMVBWvHeWHksxarGJGxbab3m96saAEkfGkyFREIqEB-PD6W4iCHwFYAuMuSPqUr4-Dy782i1AJHf2t~3~Jtdt4kTq8zg4LJ4upucve7VVkvjr2a0svzwsm0mkPkCKYoT99f72~gcjolVIRZ-P0BaGl1Kd1TpAMO4pOs-OqFwzAg3ABZEL1BKVIIFizEq7k-bRS62g36e~NPP9V4SSMaQbd2JrEBaKmDtir4R9kJW45xk7CCK0C-RIsiZxqz6zdwjhEgqQTfe2X6o9pplkLl6O2L199Z4yvsaivfqiJk3VOtspF3fLpLCui9k~5KnLGjY0hdIg3z9A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
